[
  {
    "RowOffset": 524810,
    "RowId": 32316,
    "Text": "A test of my will and training both. Hold fast, everyone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 524878,
    "RowId": 32317,
    "Text": "Well done, Gosetsu. Now, I believe it is past time we put Minato's soul to rest."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 524970,
    "RowId": 32318,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! Are you all right?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525018,
    "RowId": 32319,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! Hold on!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525058,
    "RowId": 32320,
    "Text": "Defeat Izanami"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525086,
    "RowId": 32321,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525098,
    "RowId": 32322,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525110,
    "RowId": 32323,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525122,
    "RowId": 32324,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525134,
    "RowId": 32325,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525146,
    "RowId": 32400,
    "Text": "Prove your strength to Venat!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525186,
    "RowId": 32401,
    "Text": "Let neither side hold back."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525226,
    "RowId": 32402,
    "Text": "Impressive... I shall have to try something different."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525294,
    "RowId": 32403,
    "Text": "I see you won't be easily overcome...but neither will I."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525362,
    "RowId": 32404,
    "Text": "We've only just begun. Come at me with your all!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525422,
    "RowId": 32405,
    "Text": "My blade sings!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525450,
    "RowId": 32406,
    "Text": "There!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525470,
    "RowId": 32407,
    "Text": "Have a taste!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525494,
    "RowId": 32408,
    "Text": "No quarter!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525518,
    "RowId": 32409,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525530,
    "RowId": 32410,
    "Text": "Prepare yourself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525558,
    "RowId": 32411,
    "Text": "Very well, let us move to the final trial."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525614,
    "RowId": 32412,
    "Text": "Break your chains, shed your burdens─and show me your strength of will!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525698,
    "RowId": 32413,
    "Text": "You still stand. The people of your time are more resilient than I had dared hope."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525794,
    "RowId": 32414,
    "Text": "I have seen enough."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525826,
    "RowId": 32415,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525838,
    "RowId": 32500,
    "Text": "Defeat Hesperos"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525866,
    "RowId": 32501,
    "Text": "I have awaited this moment... Witness the full measure of a hemitheos's power!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525958,
    "RowId": 32502,
    "Text": "There is but one master in Asphodelos!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526010,
    "RowId": 32503,
    "Text": "These halls are <i>my</i> domain!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526058,
    "RowId": 32504,
    "Text": "If you insist upon this folly, then you must face the full extent of my authority!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526154,
    "RowId": 32505,
    "Text": "I shall feast upon your aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526198,
    "RowId": 32506,
    "Text": "Your aether turns...and by it shall you be undone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526262,
    "RowId": 32507,
    "Text": "A rat in a maze is amusing at first, but it is still a rat─vermin to be disposed of."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526362,
    "RowId": 32508,
    "Text": "Scurry, vermin, ere my blade finds your bellies..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526426,
    "RowId": 32509,
    "Text": "This chlamys is no mere affectation, I assure you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526490,
    "RowId": 32510,
    "Text": "For trespass in my domain shall you be judged!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526550,
    "RowId": 32511,
    "Text": "Do not believe victory yours... I can yet shed this meager form and usher you back to the star!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526658,
    "RowId": 32512,
    "Text": "To him do I dedicate this transformation─this victory!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526726,
    "RowId": 32513,
    "Text": "Power courses through me! And you... You will feed my subjects!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526802,
    "RowId": 32514,
    "Text": "A tragedy unfolds within the halls of Asphodelos. Rejoice, for you are its star!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526894,
    "RowId": 32515,
    "Text": "And the final act begins! Bring your adoring fans to tears!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526966,
    "RowId": 32516,
    "Text": "To those who endured every tragic turn, stand at attention for the curtain call!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527058,
    "RowId": 32517,
    "Text": "A tragedy demands death. Discard your delusions of salvation and embrace catharsis!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527154,
    "RowId": 32518,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527166,
    "RowId": 32519,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527178,
    "RowId": 32520,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527190,
    "RowId": 32521,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527202,
    "RowId": 32522,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527214,
    "RowId": 32523,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527226,
    "RowId": 32524,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527238,
    "RowId": 32525,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527250,
    "RowId": 32526,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527262,
    "RowId": 32527,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527274,
    "RowId": 32528,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527286,
    "RowId": 32529,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527298,
    "RowId": 32530,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527310,
    "RowId": 32600,
    "Text": "'Tis said that there are no ifs in history, yet man is wont to dream. Let us dream, then, of a future where a dear comrade lived..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527454,
    "RowId": 32601,
    "Text": "Your feeble light shall fade before my brilliance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527518,
    "RowId": 32602,
    "Text": "Undone by mortal will. Whither now...?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527570,
    "RowId": 32603,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527582,
    "RowId": 32604,
    "Text": "O Ascalon! Drink deep of the power of slumbering gods!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527650,
    "RowId": 32605,
    "Text": "Y-You survived my divine reckoning!? Impossible!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527710,
    "RowId": 32606,
    "Text": "This is the power of Light? No... If I must fall, then so shall you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527790,
    "RowId": 32607,
    "Text": "Thy final verse is sung!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527826,
    "RowId": 32608,
    "Text": "Thou hast survived my song...\nCurse thee and thine eye, Hraesvelgr!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527910,
    "RowId": 32609,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527922,
    "RowId": 32610,
    "Text": "Wriggling maggots! I shall grind you to paste in my jaws!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 527990,
    "RowId": 32611,
    "Text": "I swore to Shiva─swore that I would not take the lives of men... Stop me, I prithee!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528090,
    "RowId": 32612,
    "Text": "I thank thee, servant of Hydaelyn... Now I may go to be with my beloved..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528178,
    "RowId": 32613,
    "Text": "Thus did one song draw to a close. But here and now, this minstrel shall perform another─a song of imagination transcending..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528318,
    "RowId": 32614,
    "Text": "At long last, this flesh belongeth to me! And now, wicked mortals─my dirge shall usher you unto your doom!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528438,
    "RowId": 32615,
    "Text": "Hahahaha! By the power of mine enemy's eyes, I am become a god eternal!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528522,
    "RowId": 32616,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528534,
    "RowId": 32617,
    "Text": "O Ascalon! Purge the tainted with the light of sorrow immeasurable!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528614,
    "RowId": 32618,
    "Text": "O Ascalon! Consign the wicked with the light of rancor unquenchable!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528694,
    "RowId": 32619,
    "Text": "O Ascalon! Scorch the earth with the light of regret unfathomable!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528774,
    "RowId": 32620,
    "Text": "Your time is come! Eyes of mine enemy, bring oblivion unto the unbelievers!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528862,
    "RowId": 32621,
    "Text": "Dragonsong War Progress"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528898,
    "RowId": 32622,
    "Text": "Alternate Dragonsong War Progress"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 528942,
    "RowId": 32623,
    "Text": "In pursuit of the archbishop, the Warrior of Light journeyed to Azys Lla, where <If(PlayerParameter(4))>she<Else/>he</If> confronted a primal born of the power of the Eye: King Thordan and his knights twelve."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529138,
    "RowId": 32624,
    "Text": "Though <If(PlayerParameter(4))>she<Else/>he</If> emerged victorious, <If(PlayerParameter(4))>her<Else/>his</If> comrade's body was claimed by Nidhogg, who brought his unbridled rage to bear against Ishgard."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529306,
    "RowId": 32625,
    "Text": "A single life can alter the course of history... Enslaved by an ancient relic, the great wyrm Hraesvelgr descended upon Ishgard at his vengeful brother's side."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529478,
    "RowId": 32626,
    "Text": "Thus did a dreadful new divinity arise─one endowed with the nigh-irrepressible life force of two great wyrms..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529602,
    "RowId": 32627,
    "Text": "Tell me, Warrior of Light. How do you propose to end this conflict?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529682,
    "RowId": 32628,
    "Text": "If you believe that eliminating me will undo a thousand years of strife and suffering, then you are a fool."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529802,
    "RowId": 32629,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529814,
    "RowId": 32630,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529826,
    "RowId": 32631,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529838,
    "RowId": 32632,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529850,
    "RowId": 32633,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529862,
    "RowId": 32634,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529874,
    "RowId": 32635,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 529886,
    "RowId": 32636,
