    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530006,
    "RowId": 32646,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530018,
    "RowId": 32647,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530030,
    "RowId": 32648,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530042,
    "RowId": 32649,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530054,
    "RowId": 32650,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530066,
    "RowId": 32700,
    "Text": "It should go without saying, but stay on your guard. There was quite the menagerie of horrors when last I was here."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530194,
    "RowId": 32701,
    "Text": "They're upon us! To arms!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530230,
    "RowId": 32702,
    "Text": "Merlwyb and I shall hold them off. Press on, my friends!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530298,
    "RowId": 32703,
    "Text": "A persistent lot, aren't they?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530342,
    "RowId": 32704,
    "Text": "I shall hold the line here. When you see an opening, take it, and do not look back!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530438,
    "RowId": 32705,
    "Text": "Nerva never did make things easy. Let's get this over with."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530510,
    "RowId": 32706,
    "Text": "More are coming! Stay sharp!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530550,
    "RowId": 32707,
    "Text": "There is no end to them..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530590,
    "RowId": 32708,
    "Text": "Careful there, Leveilleur. They have their sights set on you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530662,
    "RowId": 32709,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530674,
    "RowId": 32710,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530686,
    "RowId": 32711,
    "Text": "I will see to the rabble. You focus on the large one there."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530758,
    "RowId": 32712,
    "Text": "Very well. With me, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530806,
    "RowId": 32713,
    "Text": "This ends here, Nerva. For Garlemald, her people, and all who call this star home!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530902,
    "RowId": 32714,
    "Text": "Blasphemy or no, I'll not suffer anyone who gets in my way!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 530974,
    "RowId": 32715,
    "Text": "For glory...everlasting. For Garlemald!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531026,
    "RowId": 32716,
    "Text": "Hold on, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531066,
    "RowId": 32717,
    "Text": "We must take the offensive!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531106,
    "RowId": 32718,
    "Text": "To me... My legion!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531138,
    "RowId": 32719,
    "Text": "We will be overrun at this rate..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531186,
    "RowId": 32720,
    "Text": "Bring them here, and leave the rest to me."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531242,
    "RowId": 32721,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531254,
    "RowId": 32722,
    "Text": "Dammit, how could that have missed!? No matter, we will deal with them easily enough."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531350,
    "RowId": 32723,
    "Text": "Behind me, quickly! I shall take the brunt of it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531410,
    "RowId": 32724,
    "Text": "We must...drive it back!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531446,
    "RowId": 32725,
    "Text": "\\\\<pant> \\\\<pant> Gods be good..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531486,
    "RowId": 32726,
    "Text": "We've come too far...to give up now..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531538,
    "RowId": 32727,
    "Text": "Then let's put an end to this, shall we?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531590,
    "RowId": 32728,
    "Text": "No! Garlemald...is mine! MINE!!!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531634,
    "RowId": 32729,
    "Text": "No, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! Are you all right?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531686,
    "RowId": 32730,
    "Text": "Get a hold of yourself, <If(PlayerParameter(4))>woman<Else/>man</If>! We've a monster to slay!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531766,
    "RowId": 32731,
    "Text": "Reach the top of the Tower of Babil!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531814,
    "RowId": 32732,
    "Text": "Defeat Nerva's minions!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 531850,
    "RowId": 32733,
    "Text": "Defeat Nerva yae Galvus!"
  },
  {
