    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 534546,
    "RowId": 32900,
    "Text": "I have taken the liberty of preparing an <i>electrifying</i> stage for you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 534638,
    "RowId": 32901,
    "Text": "Meet one of my creations. You might find it a <i>handful</i>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 534714,
    "RowId": 32902,
    "Text": "I will lay Garlond low, but first I must break you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 534778,
    "RowId": 32903,
    "Text": "\\\\<pant> I will not suffer...to be in another's shadow!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 534842,
    "RowId": 32904,
    "Text": "Let us dance, champion of Eorzea."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 534886,
    "RowId": 32905,
    "Text": "Impressive! Now it is <i>my</i> turn!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 534938,
    "RowId": 32906,
    "Text": "Know your place!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 534966,
    "RowId": 32907,
    "Text": "Come, we shall see if you can finish what you have started."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535038,
    "RowId": 32908,
    "Text": "Eorzea is mine by right!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535074,
    "RowId": 32909,
    "Text": "That you should still stand... Very well, then!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535134,
    "RowId": 32910,
    "Text": "Arrive at the command chamber"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535174,
    "RowId": 32911,
    "Text": "Clear the command chamber"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535210,
    "RowId": 32912,
    "Text": "Arrive at the Laboratorium Primum"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535254,
    "RowId": 32913,
    "Text": "Clear the Laboratorium Primum"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535294,
    "RowId": 32914,
    "Text": "Arrive on the Echelon"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535326,
    "RowId": 32915,
    "Text": "Defeat Gaius van Baelsar"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535362,
    "RowId": 32916,
    "Text": "Right, I'll examine the equipment for intelligence. Press on─I'll let you know if I learn anything."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535474,
    "RowId": 32917,
    "Text": "Well, well, would you look at this! It's the armor we borrowed for our mission at Castrum Centri!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535582,
    "RowId": 32918,
    "Text": "If this isn't fate, I don't know what is! Go on, strap yourself in and raise hells!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535678,
    "RowId": 32919,
    "Text": "If you will not yield, then you will be destroyed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535742,
    "RowId": 32920,
    "Text": "We need to make our way down. There ought to be a terminal for the lift up ahead."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 535834,
    "RowId": 32921,
    "Text": "Here it is. If you'd care to take the van, I'll follow after I've had a look around."
  },
