  {
    "RowOffset": 536830,
    "RowId": 32997,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 536842,
    "RowId": 32998,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 536854,
    "RowId": 32999,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 536866,
    "RowId": 33000,
    "Text": "Clear Ingenuity's Foothold"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 536906,
    "RowId": 33001,
    "Text": "Clear the Path"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 536934,
    "RowId": 33002,
    "Text": "Clear the Monument to Destruction"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 536978,
    "RowId": 33003,
    "Text": "Clear the Endless City"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537014,
    "RowId": 33004,
    "Text": "Clear the Circle of Inquiry"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537054,
    "RowId": 33005,
    "Text": "Clear the Twin Halls"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537086,
    "RowId": 33006,
    "Text": "The Builder has been made to yield..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537134,
    "RowId": 33007,
    "Text": "Intriguing. Then the Destroyer shall take your measure..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537202,
    "RowId": 33008,
    "Text": "...After you have provided my servant with some sport."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537270,
    "RowId": 33009,
    "Text": "In the name of the Destroyer, I will lay you low."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537330,
    "RowId": 33010,
    "Text": "My divine axe will rend you in twain!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537378,
    "RowId": 33011,
    "Text": "Come, show me the strength of mankind!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537430,
    "RowId": 33012,
    "Text": "Upon the ground you shall crawl!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537474,
    "RowId": 33013,
    "Text": "By my authority as the Destroyer..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537522,
    "RowId": 33014,
    "Text": "I will break you body and soul!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537566,
    "RowId": 33015,
    "Text": "Wandering star, descend and destroy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537614,
    "RowId": 33016,
    "Text": "Keep a reverent distance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537650,
    "RowId": 33017,
    "Text": "Bask in my blinding resplendence!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537694,
    "RowId": 33018,
    "Text": "Can you predict your own undoing?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537738,
    "RowId": 33019,
    "Text": "Most impressive, children of man..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537786,
    "RowId": 33020,
    "Text": "A domain aspected to lightning... Byregot is here, I shouldn't doubt."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537866,
    "RowId": 33021,
    "Text": "The mechanical spire ahead could have been plucked straight out of legend!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 537954,
    "RowId": 33022,
    "Text": "That you should best a divinity... I couldn't have asked for better help!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538038,
    "RowId": 33023,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538050,
    "RowId": 33024,
    "Text": "So the gods have minions at their beck and call... We must proceed with care."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538138,
    "RowId": 33025,
    "Text": "Rhalgr isn't known as the god of destruction without reason. Steel yourself."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538226,
    "RowId": 33026,
    "Text": "Ahead stands a statue I have fashioned for our contest."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538294,
    "RowId": 33027,
    "Text": "Come, mortals. Enter my realm─if you dare."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538350,
    "RowId": 33028,
    "Text": "Another domain─one aspected to fire..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538402,
    "RowId": 33029,
    "Text": "Then the voice that called out to us..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538454,
    "RowId": 33030,
    "Text": "Mere minions are no match for you, 'twould seem."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538514,
    "RowId": 33031,
    "Text": "A divinity awaits us beyond. Have care."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538566,
    "RowId": 33032,
    "Text": "Look how the sky has changed! The result of your victory over Azeyma, I daresay..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538662,
    "RowId": 33033,
    "Text": "There's a city up ahead... Could there be people here?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538730,
    "RowId": 33034,
    "Text": "Prepare to be judged, children of man."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538782,
    "RowId": 33035,
    "Text": "Ashes you will be."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538814,
    "RowId": 33036,
    "Text": "Will you weather my trial?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538854,
    "RowId": 33037,
    "Text": "We have only just begun!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538890,
    "RowId": 33038,
    "Text": "The flames of the abyss consume all."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538938,
    "RowId": 33039,
    "Text": "Bitterest suffering awaits."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 538978,
    "RowId": 33040,
    "Text": "From ashes you came, to ashes you will return."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539038,
    "RowId": 33041,
    "Text": "Still you defy our divine authority."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539086,
    "RowId": 33042,
    "Text": "Very well. Let us proceed to your judgment."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539142,
    "RowId": 33043,
    "Text": "We, the Traders, shall weigh your souls!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539194,
    "RowId": 33044,
    "Text": "Preserve the balance if you can."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539238,
    "RowId": 33045,
    "Text": "5 seconds to Balance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539270,
    "RowId": 33046,
    "Text": "4 seconds to Balance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539302,
    "RowId": 33047,
    "Text": "3 seconds..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539326,
    "RowId": 33048,
    "Text": "2 seconds..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539350,
    "RowId": 33049,
    "Text": "1 second..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539374,
    "RowId": 33050,
    "Text": "Once more─and once more only─we shall weigh your souls."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539446,
    "RowId": 33051,
    "Text": "Preserve the balance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539478,
    "RowId": 33052,
    "Text": "The moment of judgment is come."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539522,
    "RowId": 33053,
    "Text": "You have been found wanting."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539562,
    "RowId": 33054,
    "Text": "You shall wander in purgatory for eternity."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539618,
    "RowId": 33055,
    "Text": "You have passed our judgment..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539662,
    "RowId": 33056,
    "Text": "Well done! You are deserving of reward!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539714,
    "RowId": 33057,
    "Text": "Man's tenacity is a sight to behold!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539762,
    "RowId": 33058,
    "Text": "As a show of esteem, we shall bring our all to bear."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539826,
    "RowId": 33059,
    "Text": "Hahaha! Such vim and vigor!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539866,
    "RowId": 33060,
    "Text": "So this is the spirit of man..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539910,
    "RowId": 33061,
    "Text": "You shall bear witness to our might..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 539962,
    "RowId": 33062,
    "Text": "But will you be able to comprehend it?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540014,
    "RowId": 33063,
    "Text": "That mortals should set foot in our divine realm...\nCome, we shall see whether you are fit to remain!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540130,
    "RowId": 33064,
    "Text": "So, you are resolved to face me."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540174,
    "RowId": 33065,
    "Text": "By my power shall a new world be forged."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540226,
    "RowId": 33066,
    "Text": "Come, children of man!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540262,
    "RowId": 33067,
    "Text": "Scatter!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540282,
    "RowId": 33068,
    "Text": "Tremble before my divinity!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540322,
    "RowId": 33069,
    "Text": "Behold the virtuosity of the Builder!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540370,
    "RowId": 33070,
    "Text": "Behold the works of a god!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540410,
    "RowId": 33071,
    "Text": "To me, O hammer divine!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540446,
    "RowId": 33072,
    "Text": "Searing light, smite my foes!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540486,
    "RowId": 33073,
    "Text": "The thunder is mine to command!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540530,
    "RowId": 33074,
    "Text": "If you would halt our ascension, then press on..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540590,
    "RowId": 33075,
    "Text": "Witness the glory of the divine!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540634,
    "RowId": 33076,
    "Text": "Bend the knee!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540662,
    "RowId": 33077,
    "Text": "'Tis too late to beg mercy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540702,
    "RowId": 33078,
    "Text": "You will be scoured by the light of the Sun!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540758,
    "RowId": 33079,
    "Text": "O crimson fan, in fire woven..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540802,
    "RowId": 33080,
    "Text": "In your wake leave naught uncleansed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540850,
    "RowId": 33081,
    "Text": "Is it just a mirage...or something more?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540902,
    "RowId": 33082,
    "Text": "Hahaha! I've quite warmed to you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540946,
    "RowId": 33083,
    "Text": "An explosive finish!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 540978,
    "RowId": 33084,
    "Text": "Let there be fire!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541010,
    "RowId": 33085,
    "Text": "Raging flames, dance upon the wind!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541058,
    "RowId": 33086,
    "Text": "None can escape the inferno!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541098,
    "RowId": 33087,
    "Text": "This will burn!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541126,
    "RowId": 33088,
    "Text": "A gift of flame for our children!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541170,
    "RowId": 33089,
    "Text": "Ever shall the fires burn..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541210,
    "RowId": 33100,
    "Text": "Every soul in this domain ssserves me now.<<key>>Come, feassst upon their flesh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541298,
    "RowId": 33101,
    "Text": "さぁ、餌の時間だ…！"
  }
]